 * 4. Attempt to update admin (as privileged) with duplicate email/username (matching existing adminB): expect validation error (TestValidator.error).
 *
 * Constraints:
 * - Only implement steps that are possible with the available SDK (POST, PUT-by-ID). GET, audit log, or authentication context switching is not explicitly available and will be omitted.
 * - Permissions and authentication context must be simulated as far as possible, but true user context switching is not feasible with the supplied SDK.
 */
