 * - Retrieve a paginated list of settings for the discussion board
 * - Apply various filters, including by section, owner, setting key, created/updated dates
 * - Receive paginated results containing only relevant settings
 * - See correct pagination/metadata and sorting in the response
 *
 * It also validates failure scenarios:
 * - Sending invalid filter values or malformed pagination parameters triggers validation errors
 * - Non-admin users are forbidden from accessing this endpoint, confirming RBAC enforcement
 *
 * Test process:
 * 1. As an admin, list all discussion board settings (with no filters)
 * 2. As an admin, apply several filters (section, owner, setting key, creation/update date)
