 * consistently enforced at the API layer. Does not attempt to test TS-level compilation errors.
 *
 * Steps:
 * 1. Prepare a member (dependency: /discussionboard/members).
 * 2. Build a valid base comment report DTO for mutation.
 * 3. Attempt to submit reports with each of the following invalid cases:
 *    - Bad UUID in "commentId"
 *    - Bad UUID in "memberId"
 *    - Bad UUID in "reasonCode"
