 * 2. A moderator/admin editing any post
 * 3. Another regular member attempting to update someone else's post, which should be denied
 * 4. Schema validation edge cases, like updating with empty title/body or malformed types (should fail)
 * 5. Attempting to update a deleted or non-existent post (not found error)
 * 6. After successful edit, audit/edit history must be preserved or updated.
