 * 4. memberA attempts to submit a duplicate report on the same post (should fail with 409/validation error).
 * 5. memberA attempts to report a non-existent post (should fail with 404 error).
 * 6. memberB attempts to report their own post (should fail due to business rule of self-report block).
 * 7. Attempt to report a post while not authenticated (should fail with authentication error).
 */
