 * 2. Author creates two posts (published and hidden, though in code both are equivalent)
 * 3. Fetch post by ID for published post — as author, as admin, as other member (technically identical API result here)
 * 4. Fetch by ID for 'hidden' post — as author, as admin, as member (again, identical results)
 * 5. Attempt to fetch a nonexistent post (expect error)
 * 6. For each fetch, assert with typia and sanity-check presence of ID field
